== About

Keyun Cheng is a Ph.D. student supervised by [https://www.cse.cuhk.edu.hk/~pclee Patrick P. C. Lee].
He is a member of [http://adslab.cse.cuhk.edu.hk/ Applied Distributed System Lab] (ADSLab).
He received the B.Eng degree in [https://cse.sysu.edu.cn/ Software Engineering]
from [http://www.sysu.edu.cn/ Sun Yat-Sen University] in 2018,
the M.Sc. degree in [http://msc.cse.cuhk.edu.hk Computer Science]
from [https://www.cuhk.edu.hk/ The Chinese University of Hong Kong] in 2019.

His research interests include distributed storage systems and erasure coding.


== Education

- 2020.08 - Present: Ph.D. in Computer Science and Engineering, The Chinese University of Hong Kong
- 2018.08 - 2019.07: M.Sc. in Computer Science, The Chinese University of Hong Kong
- 2014.08 - 2018.07: B.Eng in Software Engineering, Sun Yat-Sen University


